Points (1) to (3), (5)(b) and (6) of Article [70](#article-70-amendments-to-directive-2012-27-eu) shall apply from 1 January 2021.

Point (5)(a) of Article [70](#article-70-amendments-to-directive-2012-27-eu) shall apply from 1 January 2020.

Point (4) of Article [70](#article-70-amendments-to-directive-2012-27-eu) shall apply from 26 October 2020.

### Article 74 – Addressees

[This Directive](/en/lagstiftning/elmarknadsdirektivet) is addressed to the Member States.

